7] [17592186147593 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442102 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147593 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442103 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147593 #edb/ref 1039 "Finding Part of a Number Given a Whole and a Percentage" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147593 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186147248 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147593 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "3626bdd2-ec13-5d74-a570-ec65ba682723" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147594 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186147870 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147594 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186147871 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147594 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442095 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147594 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442096 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147594 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442099 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147594 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442104 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147594 #edb/ref 1039 "Finding Part of a Number Given a Whole and a Decimal Percentage" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147594 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186147249 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147594 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "163d387b-3fd7-5f95-8245-5fb0184b371b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186048806 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186147872 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186147873 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442097 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442101 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442105 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442106 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186491195 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1039 "Finding Part of a Number Given a Whole and a Percentage Greater Than 100%" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186147250 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "176069e4-4aa3-58cd-a04e-a70e7e5da960" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186148561 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186148562 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186148563 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186148564 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045463 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1045 "Finding Part of a Number Given a Whole and a Percentage: Word Problems" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1046 #edb/ref 17592186148561 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1049 #edb/ref 17592186049467 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1050 420.0 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "ce8303ff-2050-5cb3-8c68-076feb3951ea" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148561 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186148562 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148561 #edb/ref 1061 7956 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148561 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "6f30bc9e-6f94-5aa2-a2a2-62ed9c078df2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148561 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186148699 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148562 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186148563 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148562 #edb/ref 1061 7957 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148562 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "6d044eff-fad0-5933-9034-a4181e67deeb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148562 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186147593 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148563 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186148564 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148563 #edb/ref 1061 7959 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148563 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "61efc867-f64d-544b-ba1c-5cfc49f6333b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148563 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186147594 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148564 #edb/ref 1061 7960 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148564 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "55dcb5aa-7569-519c-a7c0-b114e3d83f67" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148564 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186147595 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148699 #edb/ref 1064 "Percentages are *very* common in everyday life. For example, they are used in retail, finance, and sports! In this lesson, we will learn how to calculate the percentage of a whole number in real-world situations.\n\nFor example, suppose Daniel and Luisa traveled $200$ kilometers in their car. If Luisa drove $40 \\%$ of the way, how many kilometers did she drive?\n\nTo solve this problem, we can use the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\textrm{part} = \\textrm{percentage} \\times \\textrm{whole}\n$$\n\nIn this case, the whole is the number of kilometers traveled, which is $200$ kilometers. The percentage is $40 \\%,$ and the part is the distance Luisa drove.\n\nAs usual, we can use two methods to solve this problem:\n\n**Method 1**\n\nFirst, we convert the percentage to a decimal: \n\n$$\n40 \\% = 40 \\div 100  = 0.4\n$$\n\nApplying our formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{part} & =\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole} \\\\  & =40%\\times 200 \\\\  & =0.4\\times 200 \\\\  & =80.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo Luisa drove $80$ kilometers.\n\n**Method 2**\n\nFirst, we convert the percentage to a fraction:\n\n$$\n40 \\% = \\dfrac{40}{100} = \\dfrac{40 \\div 20}{100 \\div 20} = \\dfrac{2}{5}\n$$\n\nApplying the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{part} & =\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole} \\\\  & =40%\\times 200 \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5}\\times 200 \\\\  & =\\frac{400}{5} \\\\  & =80.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAgain, we find that Luisa drove $80$ kilometers." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148699 #edb/ref 1065 2080 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148699 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "b32fe964-00bc-58b8-8e13-0ebde913bd87" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148699 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152124 #edb/ref 